# Agente de IA integrado ao WhatsApp

<div align="center">

[![Status](https://img.shields.io/badge/status-em%20desenvolvimento-blue)](https://github.com/Usguri/Agente-de-IA-integrado-ao-WhatsApp)
[![PHP](https://img.shields.io/badge/PHP-8.x-777BB4?logo=php&logoColor=white)](https://www.php.net/)
[![AI](https://img.shields.io/badge/IA-Chatbot%20Inteligente-orange)](https://github.com/Usguri/Agente-de-IA-integrado-ao-WhatsApp)
